WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:04.760
With the data in hand, MileInvestiga
applies more than twenty

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:08.940
artificial intelligence models to
the evidence in under two seconds.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:12.649
Faces, plates and scenes
identified in real time.

00:00:12.649 --> 00:00:14.415
Voice transcribed and translated.

00:00:14.415 --> 00:00:17.530
Text analyzed with natural language processing.

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:24.133
The criminal network graph is
revealed with centrality analysis,

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:28.470
and spatio-temporal patterns show
who operates, where and how often.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:34.208 line:72% position:50% size:90%
AlejoGeo cross-references everything with
open sources and the client's databases.

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:38.585 line:72% position:50% size:90%
And in the end, the human analyst
interprets the result with judgment.
